        "fontFamily": "Prompt, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 300,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "This is to certify that  \nof American nationality, holding passport number US98765432, currently employed by Zenith Global Solutions as Senior Project Manager.",
      "autoScale": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "style": {
        "top": "39.572903629536924%",
        "left": "9.557522123893806%",
        "color": "#020202",
        "width": "79.46902654867256%",
        "height": "auto",
        "fontSize": "18em",
        "fontStyle": "normal",
        "textAlign": "left",
        "fontFamily": "Prompt, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 300,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "During his tenure, Mr. Thompson demonstrated exceptional commitment and consistently produced high-quality results in every project he managed. His work ethic, professionalism, and leadership skills greatly benefited the company and earned him the respect of his colleagues and supervisors.",
      "autoScale": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "style": {
        "top": "53.81727158948686%",
        "left": "9.557522123893806%",
        "color": "#020202",
        "width": "79.46902654867256%",
        "height": "auto",
        "fontSize": "18em",
        "fontStyle": "normal",
        "textAlign": "left",
        "fontFamily": "Prompt, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 300,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "Mr. Thompson\u2019s compensation package included the following:\n1. Basic Salary of $90,000 annually\n2. Housing Allowance of $1,500 monthly\n3. Transportation Allowance of $500 monthly",
      "autoScale": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "style": {
        "top": "65.84167709637046%",
        "left": "9.557522123893806%",
        "color": "#020202",
        "width": "79.46902654867256%",
        "height": "auto",
        "fontSize": "18em",
        "fontStyle": "normal",
        "textAlign": "left",
        "fontFamily": "Prompt, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 300,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "This certificate is issued to him without any liability on the part of Zenith Global Solutions.",
      "autoScale": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "style": {
        "top": "72.96620775969961%",
        "left": "9.557522123893806%",
        "color": "#020202",
