        "fontStyle": "normal",
        "textAlign": "left",
        "fontFamily": "Prompt, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 300,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "We take this opportunity to thank Mr. Thompson for his contributions to the company and wish him all the best in his future endeavors.",
      "autoScale": false
